WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.870 --> 00:00:03.000
- Hi, everyone, Sal here from Khan Academy

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.790
and I just wanted to make an announcement

00:00:04.790 --> 00:00:07.670
of something that I think
many of you will find useful.

00:00:07.670 --> 00:00:09.820
I have a little bit of
a side project going on

00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:12.140
called schoolhouse.world.

00:00:12.140 --> 00:00:14.780
It isn't an official Khan Academy project,

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:16.990
but it's a way to get free tutoring.

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:20.140
Yes, I'm talking about free live tutoring.

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:23.240
What happens on schoolhouse.world
is you as a student

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:25.390
can go and say what areas

00:00:25.390 --> 00:00:26.850
and we're starting with high school math,

00:00:26.850 --> 00:00:29.170
what areas of high school
math you need help in

00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:31.820
and you can see existing tutoring sessions

00:00:31.820 --> 00:00:35.030
that are scheduled in the
coming days and coming weeks

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.040
and on the other side,
we have volunteer tutors

00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:42.230
who look at what students,
what you, might need help in

00:00:42.230 --> 00:00:45.010
and will schedule these
group tutoring sessions.

00:00:45.010 --> 00:00:47.810
So whether you're interested
in being a student

00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:50.010
and getting some free live help

00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:52.550
or that you're interested
in being a tutor or both,

00:00:52.550 --> 00:00:54.030
check out schoolhouse.world.

00:00:54.030 --> 00:00:55.930
There's a little bit of
a registration process.

00:00:55.930 --> 00:00:59.010
This is really a startup project right now

00:00:59.010 --> 00:00:59.950
where we're trying to make sure

00:00:59.950 --> 00:01:02.200
we balance the tutors and the students,

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:03.340
but I'll tell you right now

00:01:03.340 --> 00:01:06.360
we have an incredible
number of amazing tutors

00:01:06.360 --> 00:01:08.960
and actually we're looking
for more students to tutor.

00:01:08.960 --> 00:01:11.400
So check it out, fill out the form

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:14.127
and you will be able to get some help

00:01:14.127 --> 00:01:15.560
and the view is you can learn

00:01:15.560 --> 00:01:17.870
at your own time and pace on Khan Academy.

00:01:17.870 --> 00:01:20.950
Obviously we have the
exercises, the feedback there.

00:01:20.950 --> 00:01:22.240
You have the videos.

00:01:22.240 --> 00:01:24.500
We just launched our Get
Ready for Grade Level courses.

00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:25.770
You can use that as well.

00:01:25.770 --> 00:01:28.070
And then when you need in-person help,

00:01:28.070 --> 00:01:30.423
you can go to schoolhouse.world.

